    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d637">

                <pb facs="0722" n="710" sameAs="frus:frus1943v02/pg710"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">811.79652/30: Telegram</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The Secretary of State to the
                        Ambassador in Spain</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic"
                            >Hayes</hi>)</head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Washington</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1943-12-06T22:00:00-04:00">December 6,
                            1943—10 p.m.</date>
                    </dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>2583. The Department believes, in answer to 3498, November 29, 4 p.m.<anchor
                        n="65" xml:id="d637-f1"/> that it might be advisable for you to inform your
                    British colleague that Spain has granted us temporary landing rights for
                    American commercial airlines. You might add that this was on a basis entirely
                    separate and apart from the question of aviation gasoline; that we hope to begin
                    a token service in the near future on a limited basis; and that we are beginning
                    to work out plans looking to a service which possibly may transit Spain. It
                    might also be <pb facs="0723" n="711" xml:id="pg711"/> advisable to point out to
                    him that because of Spain’s neutrality we were naturally required to stress the
                    commercial aspect of the service.</p>
                <p>The Department will give corresponding advice to the British Embassy here.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Hull</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
